==============================================================================
Sensor plausibility filter
==============================================================================
  ambient_max                 115 readings outside [5.0, 40.0] -> NaN

  These are sensor faults, not measurements. A 44 degC rack inlet
  is not a real inlet temperature and would distort both the
  ASHRAE statistics and the thermal model.

